01:07:39.250 --> 01:07:40.250
Aku…

01:07:45.458 --> 01:07:46.833
Entahlah. Maksudku…

01:07:51.458 --> 01:07:52.541
Kurasa aku…

01:07:54.583 --> 01:07:56.958
