01:13:17.541 --> 01:13:19.000
-Tampak keren.
-Terima kasih.

01:13:19.083 --> 01:13:20.583
Maya, hai.

01:13:21.708 --> 01:13:23.541
Selamat datang. Senang menyambutmu.

01:13:24.666 --> 01:13:26.958
Kau sangat Prancis. Maaf.

01:13:27.041 --> 01:13:29.416
-Ya… aku sering dengar.
-Sudah kubilang.

01:13:29.500 --> 01:13:31.916
Maaf, aku tak bisa sembunyikan.
Terima kasih.

01:13:33.166 --> 01:13:34.458
Kerja bagus, Ayah.

01:13:34.541 --> 01:13:36.041
-Terima kasih.
-Aku tahu isinya.

01:13:36.125 --> 01:13:37.875
