01:13:49.916 --> 01:13:53.125
-Itu memang sangat tak pantas.
-Memang tak pantas.

01:13:53.208 --> 01:13:54.208
-Anna?
-Ya.

01:13:54.291 --> 01:13:55.500
Apa masih ada merah?

01:13:55.583 --> 01:13:56.833
-Ya. Maaf.
-Terima kasih.

01:13:56.916 --> 01:13:58.250
-Mau ucapkan selamat?
-Ya.

